<title>FINLAND: FINNISH AUG BUILDING PERMITS UP 28 PCT YR/YR - SF.</title>
<headline>FINNISH AUG BUILDING PERMITS UP 28 PCT YR/YR - SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The construction volume for which building permits were granted rose 28 percent year-on-year in August to 2.7 million cubic metres, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>In January-August, building permits granted rose 26 percent year-on-year to 21.6 million cubic metres, it said.</p>
</text>
